    {
      "id": 16,
      "title": "AI-Powered Car Defect Detection",
      "description": "Automated system that detects surface-level car defects using YOLOv7 and CNN — reducing manual inspection effort by 70% and processing each vehicle in under 25ms.",
      "long_description": "In automotive manufacturing, surface defects like scratches, dents, and paint overflow can slip past manual inspections — costing time, money, and customer trust.\n\nThis project replaces the manual inspection pipeline with a fully automated, image-based defect detection system. A car surface image goes in, and within milliseconds the system identifies and localizes every defect with bounding boxes, classifications, and severity levels.\n\nThe detection pipeline combines YOLOv7 for real-time object localization with a custom CNN for precise defect classification. The model was trained on a custom dataset annotated with Roboflow, achieving over 85% precision and recall across all defect categories.\n\nThe system is deployed as a Flask web application — inspectors upload an image, and results appear instantly with visual overlays showing exactly where each defect is and what type it is.",
      "image_url": "/uploads/images/1777531686781-ebc5dfde-23c3-461b-9c08-470a93bfb92e.jpg",
      "demo_url": null,
      "github_url": "https://github.com/your-username/car-defect-detection",
      "tech_stack": [
        "YOLOv7",
        "CNN",
        "Python",
        "PyTorch",
        "TensorFlow",
        "Flask",
        "OpenCV",
        "Roboflow"
      ],
      "featured": true,
      "order": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-04-30T06:11:09.836Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-04-30T07:44:13.242Z",
      "video_url": "https://youtu.be/v_XrPCiBeUg?si=m6niPfFK_s2b_2Dw",
      "category": "development",
      "highlights": [
        "Reduced manual inspection effort by 70% through full automation",
        "Achieved 89% detection accuracy for scratches, 87% for dirt, 88% for paint defects",
        "Real-time processing at ~25ms per image — fast enough for production lines",
        "Custom Roboflow dataset with precision and recall rates exceeding 85%",
        "Flask web interface for instant upload-and-detect workflow",
        "Decreased inspection time per vehicle by 50% compared to manual process"
      ],
      "metrics": {
